+
+- Phase 1: T001 (toolchain) is independent; T002 (baseline) needs the toolchain.
+- Phase 2: T003 is a read-only confirmation, independent.
+- Phase 3: T004 (US1 e2e test, in `api_http.rs`) is independent of the implementation tasks (in `serve/mod.rs`) and can be authored while T003 runs; T005–T012 are ordered within the shared `serve/mod.rs` file and are NOT parallel with each other.
